<!-- ═══════ 01 — VISUAL AESTHETICS ═══════ -->
<section class="sc-sz sc-sz-sec">
  <div class="sc-sz-sec__inner">
    <div class="sc-sz-sec__header">
      <span class="sc-sz-sec__num">01 / Visual Aesthetics</span>
      <span class="sc-sz-sec__line"></span>
    </div>
    <p class="sc-sz-sec__kicker">Chapter One</p>
    <h2 class="sc-sz-sec__title">Gym? No, It's a Piece<br>of Modern Furniture.</h2>

    <div class="sc-sz-article">
      <div class="sc-sz-article__main">
        <p>Traditional home gym equipment has always been defined by crude spray paint, exposed iron weight stacks, and a ruthless disruption of your living space. When left unused, they inevitably devolve into awkward clothes racks in the corner of a room.</p>
        <p>At Sensol, we believe in the aesthetics of restraint. Whether it is the sleek agility of the <strong>FLEX AIR (28KG)</strong> or the commanding presence of the <strong>RS03 PRO (52KG)</strong>, our lineup is wrapped in high-strength, aerospace-grade aluminum with minimalist industrial lines. They don't just exist in your home; they seamlessly disappear into a modern Melbourne apartment or a coastal Sydney residence.</p>
        <p>It's not just equipment&mdash;it is digital furniture designed for the modern interior. Every curve, every finish, every silhouette is considered against the architecture of contemporary living. The result is something unprecedented: training equipment that you are proud to display, not desperate to hide.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="sc-sz-article__side">
        <p class="sc-sz-article__side-label">In This Chapter</p>
        <div class="sc-sz-article__side-item">
          <p class="sc-sz-article__side-item-name">Material</p>
          <p class="sc-sz-article__side-item-val">Aerospace-grade aluminum</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-sz-article__side-item">
          <p class="sc-sz-article__side-item-name">Design Language</p>
          <p class="sc-sz-article__side-item-val">Minimalist industrial</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-sz-article__side-item">
          <p class="sc-sz-article__side-item-name">Featured Models</p>
          <p class="sc-sz-article__side-item-val">FLEX AIR, RS03 PRO</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-sz-article__side-item">
          <p class="sc-sz-article__side-item-name">Philosophy</p>
          <p class="sc-sz-article__side-item-val">Aesthetics of restraint</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <div class="sc-sz-pull">
      <p class="sc-sz-pull__text">"They don't just exist in your home; they seamlessly disappear into it."</p>
      <p class="sc-sz-pull__attr">Sensol Editorial</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════ 02 — DIGITAL MOTORS (dark) ═══════ -->
<section class="sc-sz sc-sz-dark">
  <div class="sc-sz-dark__inner">
    <div class="sc-sz-dark__header">
      <span class="sc-sz-dark__num">02 / Digital Motors</span>
      <span class="sc-sz-dark__line"></span>
    </div>
    <p class="sc-sz-dark__kicker">Chapter Two</p>
    <h2 class="sc-sz-dark__title">The Science Behind<br>Weightless Weight.</h2>
    <p class="sc-sz-dark__lead">The secret to shedding hundreds of kilograms of physical iron plates lies within our precision Digital Resistance Control System.</p>

    <div class="sc-sz-dark__body" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
      <p>Traditional gravity-based training introduces micro-fluctuations and momentum shifts during the concentric and eccentric phases, which is often the root cause of joint strain and standard training plateaus.</p>
      <p>Driven by an intelligent motor control chip executing <strong>thousands of dynamic recalculations per second</strong>, Sensol delivers absolute, liquid-smooth resistance. Whether you are chasing explosive velocity with the FLEX AIR or demanding peak mechanical overload at 45kg with the RS03 PRO, our digital motor senses your force trajectory in milliseconds, providing a pure, unadulterated pump that traditional dumbbells simply cannot replicate.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature callouts -->
    <div class="sc-sz-callouts">
      <div class="sc-sz-callout">
        <span class="sc-sz-callout__num">1000<span class="sc-sz-callout__unit">+/sec</span></span>
        <p class="sc-sz-callout__label">Recalculations</p>
        <p class="sc-sz-callout__text">Dynamic resistance adjustments per second, adapting to your force trajectory in real time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-sz-callout">
        <span class="sc-sz-callout__num">45<span class="sc-sz-callout__unit">kg</span></span>
        <p class="sc-sz-callout__label">Max Resistance</p>
        <p class="sc-sz-callout__text">Digital motor delivers up to 45kg resistance with 1kg adjustment precision across Standard, Centrifugal, and Elastic modes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-sz-callout">
        <span class="sc-sz-callout__num">25<span class="sc-sz-callout__unit">dB</span></span>
        <p class="sc-sz-callout__label">Operating Volume</p>
        <p class="sc-sz-callout__text">Whisper-quiet operation that respects your space and the people sharing it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

